Consider the following procedure.

```text
PROCEDURE find(list, limit)
{
   FOR EACH item IN list
   {
      IF (item > limit)
      {
         RETURN (item)
      }
   }
   RETURN (-1)
}
```

What is returned by `find([12, 17, 6, 12, 27, 7], 12)`?

